{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"仿射直线对乘法群的商"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"A1-Gm"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>仿射直线 $\\mathbb A^1 = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x] = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[\\mathbb{N}]$ 上有"},{"Local":{"url":"乘法群概形","text":"乘法群"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb G_m = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x^{\\pm 1}] = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[\\mathbb{Z}]$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"群作用","text":"作用"}},{"Plain":". 在 $\\mathsf{Aff}$ 上的 ($\\mathsf{Ani}$-值 fpqc) 层范畴中取其商, 记作 $\\mathbb A^1 / \\mathbb G_m$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>单纯消解</h3>\n<p>由 $\\mathbb A^1\\to \\mathbb A^1 / \\mathbb G_m$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Čech脉","text":"Čech 脉"}},{"Plain":" (其"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"为 $\\mathbb A^1 / \\mathbb G_m$) 可以将 $\\mathsf{QCoh}(\\mathbb A^1 / \\mathbb G_m)$ "},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"为余单纯范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{QCoh}(\\mathbb A^1) \\rightrightarrows \\mathsf{QCoh}(\\mathbb A^1 \\times \\mathbb G_m) \\to^3 \\cdots\r\n$$\n的极限.</p>\n<h3>与滤的关系</h3>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"fil-gr","text":"滤与分次的叠观点"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}